  "description": {
    "text": "The 1st Certified Tournament of Champions League 2018 was an authorized tournament run by the company Arclight, held at Sunshine City in Ikebukuro, Tokyo, on 26 November 2017. Its top finishers in each league won Victory Decoration, with the year and the city in the foil, in a print for their place: Champion, 2nd Place, or 3rd Place for both the third and fourth. Its entrants' Welcome Kit held Tapu Koko 154/SM-P with the Champions League Certified Tournament logo."
  },
